To ensure seamless traffic convergence for IPv6-labeled unicast services during BGP peer failures, configure the following on your Nokia 7750 SR routers:

```
configure router bgp
    backup-path label-ipv6
    add-paths
        label-ipv6 send 2 receive
    exit
