User Request:  
"During our core network upgrade, we're implementing redundant IBGP sessions across multiple route reflectors and need to ensure optimal traffic distribution. What's the recommended approach to configure multipath load balancing for IBGP routes with identical MED values and AS-path lengths on Nokia 7750 SR OS platforms, particularly when dealing with full-mesh iBGP peerings where all paths appear equally preferable?"

