To enable BGP graceful restart with explicit signaling for NOTIFICATION message compatibility on your Nokia 7750 SR router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        enable-notification
    exit
exit
```

### Key details:
1. **`graceful-restart`**: Enables BGP graceful restart procedures at the global BGP level.
2. **`enable-notification`**: Explicitly signals that the router supports NOTIFICATION messages during graceful restart, ensuring seamless recovery with compatible peers.

This configuration:
- Advertises graceful restart capabilities to peers during session establishment.
- Preserves forwarding during maintenance events where NOTIFICATION messages are exchanged.
- Uses the default restart time (120 seconds at the global BGP level). Adjust `restart-time <value>` under `graceful-restart` if custom timers are needed.
