To enforce validation of the originating AS in EBGP routes and handle mismatches according to your update-fault-tolerance policy, configure the following:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group "EBGP_GROUP"  # Replace with your group name
        neighbor 192.0.2.1  # Replace with peer IP
