  - `flow-ipv4` (IPv4 flow-specific routes)  
  - `flow-ipv6` (IPv6 flow-specific routes)  
- All other address families (e.g., IPv4, VPN-IPv4, IPv6) retain their default F-bit behavior (`0`), maintaining normal forwarding-plane operation.  
- The configuration is applied globally under BGP but can also be set per-group or per-neighbor if granular control is needed.  

