To enable propagation of multiple path alternatives for unlabeled IPv4 prefixes and support multipath route negotiation, configure the following BGP settings:

```cli
configure router bgp
    backup-path ipv4
    group <group_name>
        add-paths
            ipv4 send 4 receive
        exit
