To ensure seamless VPN service continuity during your dual-stack migration, configure the following BGP commands on your Nokia 7750 SR routers. These steps will advertise VPNv4 prefixes and labeled IPv6 routes over IPv6 transport while setting the IPv6 neighbor address as the next-hop:

```console
configure router bgp
    group "IPV6_PEER_GROUP"
        family vpn-ipv4
        family label-ipv6
        neighbor 2001:db8::1
            advertise-ipv6-next-hops vpn-ipv4 label-ipv6
            extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
            next-hop-self
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Key configuration details:**  
1. `family vpn-ipv4` and `family label-ipv6` activate support for VPNv4 and labeled IPv6 routes.  
