To ensure VPNv4 prefixes are propagated over IPv6 transport with an IPv6 next-hop address, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group <IPv6_Transport_Group>
        family vpn-ipv4
        advertise-ipv6-next-hops vpn-ipv4
    exit
exit
```

**Key details:**
- Replace `<IPv6_Transport_Group>` with your BGP group name for IPv6 peers.
- The `advertise-ipv6-next-hops vpn-ipv4` command forces VPNv4 routes to use IPv6 next-hops when:
  - The underlying transport is IPv6
  - Next-hop-self is applied (manually or automatically)
