3. **`backup-path ipv6`**: Precomputes backup paths for IPv6 prefixes to ensure rapid failover if primary paths become unavailable.  
4. **`use-bgp-routes`**: Ensures recursive BGP next-hop resolution via BGP-learned routes, maintaining path reachability during convergence.  

