To restrict BGP next-hop binding exclusively to predefined tunnel interfaces, use the following configuration:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunn
                family ipv4
                    resolution filter
                    resolution-filter sr-te rsvp
                exit
                family ipv6
                    resolution filter
                    resolution-filter sr-te rsvp
                exit
            exit
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family ipv4
                        resolution filter
                        resolution-filter sr-te rsvp
                    exit
                    family ipv6
                        resolution filter
                        resolution-filter sr-te rsvp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

