    group "RR_CLUSTER"
        cluster 192.0.2.1 orr-location 1
    exit
exit
```

**Key notes:**
- Replace `192.0.2.1` with your actual cluster ID (must match across all RRs in the cluster)
- Use the same cluster ID on all redundant route reflectors to trigger CLUSTER_LIST loop detection
- ORR (`orr-location`) is recommended for large-scale networks to provide clients with optimal paths from their location perspective
- Client neighbors must be explicitly configured under the route reflector group

**Loop Prevention Mechanism:**  
